7. XPT2046_Touchscreen touch read sequence  (MIT)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Source:     XPT2046_Touchscreen.cpp / XPT2046_Touchscreen.h
  Copyright:  (c) 2015, Paul Stoffregen, paul@pjrc.com
  License:    MIT
  Upstream:   https://github.com/PaulStoffregen/XPT2046_Touchscreen

  Used by:    packages/framework-esp32/src/touch/xpt2046-esp32.ts
                (the XPT2046 read sequence: Z1/Z2 pressure computation,
